flowchart TD
    UI[Existing catalogue / numeric controls] --> Draft[One blueprint draft generation]
    UI --> GUI[GUI / modal ownership: no world click-through]
    Camera[Active camera / aim / projection / viewport] --> Revision[Candidate revision]
    Draft --> Revision
    Changes[Committed geometry / relevant actual blocker motion] --> Revision
    Revision --> Pick[Queued physics-safe rear ray]
    Pick --> Surface{Closest solid is actual rear-ground collider?}
    Surface -->|No: roof / table / wall| Blocked[Invalidate old point / blocked feedback]
    Surface -->|Yes: finite X/Z| Ghost[Cheap provisional footprint / door hint]
    Explicit[Explicit full Preview] --> Full[Construction.preview: checked candidate stamp]
    Full --> Ghost
    Click[Fresh world press after focus/capture] --> Seal[Seal current identities + generation + candidate]
    Ghost --> Seal
    Seal --> Current{Still current / permitted input owner?}
    Current -->|No| Drop[Discard obsolete intent: no retry]
    Current -->|Yes, consume once| Confirm[BaseDemo.confirm_build_at]
    Confirm --> Place[Construction.place: one full authoritative check]
    Place --> Result{Actual result}
    Result -->|Failure| Keep[Exact reason / retain draft and rotation]
    Result -->|Success| Site[Actual site ID + existing material/labour work]
    Site --> Clear[Select site / clear only successful draft]
    Escape[RMB / Esc in preview] --> DraftOnly[Clear draft only: never cancel site]
    Site --> Select[Existing selected-site management]
    Select --> Safeguard[Request cancel / loss disclosure / Keep construction]
    Safeguard --> Decision{Same session / service / site / selection / loss?}
    Decision -->|No| NoCancel[Nothing cancelled]
    Decision -->|Confirmed once| Cancel[Construction.cancel]
    Cancel --> Recovery[Real hauls / builders released / remaining stock recovery]
    Recovery --> Display[Truthful site/material proxy state, not full facility-art claim]
